Package: com.huhansibuxin.powerlogprobe
Name: PowerlogProbe
Version: 1.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: RELEASE build for com.apple.aggregated. Drops only pure diagnostic telemetry (25 prefixes) before the final SQLite INSERT; everything else, including Settings > Battery per-App energy percentages, stays stock. Hooks only PLSQLiteConnection writeEntry:/writeArrayEntries:, so PLCoreStorage rowids, completions, qualification and hourly aggregates are untouched. No log file, no timers, no polling, no Foundation link. Emergency kill switch: empty file PASSTHROUGH_ALL or DISABLED in /var/mobile/Documents/PowerlogProbe/ then kickstart -k system/com.apple.aggregated.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
